    "<div class=\"metadata-header\" style=\"display:none;\">informatica|BancosDeDados|Relacionais|SQL</div><div class=\"canvas-box\" data-id=\"box-17802583188390.25343471847220744\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 86px; top: 31px; width: 577px; height: 470px; z-index: 3;  \"><table style=\"min-width: 365px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"width: 340px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Símbolo</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Significado</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>[abc]</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>a, b ou c</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>[^abc]</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Qualquer caractere exceto a, b ou c</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>[0-9]</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Dígitos de 0 a 9</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>[A-Z]</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Letras maiúsculas</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>\\d</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Dígito (em muitos motores regex)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>\\w</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Letra, número ou <code>_</code></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>\\s</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"340\"><p>Espaço em branco</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"min-width: 368px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"width: 343px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Símbolo</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"343\"><p>Significado</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>{n}</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"343\"><p>Exatamente n ocorrências</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>{n,}</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"343\"><p>Pelo menos n ocorrências</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>{n,m}</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"343\"><p>Entre n e m ocorências</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p></div>",
    "<div class=\"metadata-header\" style=\"display:none;\">informatica|BancosDeDados|Relacionais|SQL</div><div class=\"canvas-box\" data-id=\"box-17802604991860.21147310263893726\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 52px; top: 42px; width: 683px; height: 451px; z-index: 16;  \"><table style=\"min-width: 462px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"min-width: 25px;\"><col style=\"width: 437px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p>Cláusula</p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Função</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>SELECT</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Escolhe as colunas a retornar</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>FROM</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Define a(s) tabela(s) consultada(s)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>WHERE</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Filtra linhas antes dos agrupamentos</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>GROUP BY</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Agrupa registros</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>HAVING</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Filtra grupos (<strong><em>vem depois de group by</em></strong>)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>ORDER BY</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Ordena o resultado</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>DISTINCT</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Remove duplicidades</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>JOIN</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Combina tabelas</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><code>ON</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Define a condição do JOIN</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Principais cláusulas SQL</h2><p></p></div>",
    "<div class=\"metadata-header\" style=\"display:none;\">informatica|BancosDeDados|Relacionais|SQL</div><div class=\"canvas-box\" data-id=\"box-17802605667180.33642014577215884\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 49px; top: 53px; width: 707px; height: 430px; z-index: 44;  \"><table style=\"min-width: 462px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 122px;\"><col style=\"width: 437px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"122\"><p><code>UNION</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Combina os resultados de dois <code>SELECT</code> e <strong>elimina duplicatas</strong>.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"122\"><p><code>UNION ALL</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>Também combina os resultados, mas <strong>mantém as duplicatas</strong>.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"122\"><p><code>LIMIT</code></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"437\"><p>O <code>LIMIT</code> restringe a quantidade de registros retornados.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SELECT nome FROM clientes_rs </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 81, 81); font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>UNION</em></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SELECT nome FROM clientes_sc;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SELECT nome FROM clientes_rs </span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 81, 81); font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>UNION ALL </em></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SELECT nome FROM clientes_sc;</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 3;\"><strong><em>SELECT * FROM clientes </em></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 81, 81);\"><strong><em>LIMIT</em></strong></span><strong><em> 10;</em></strong></p></div>"
